  "why": "A public milestone is useful only when a reader can follow real source rows through ontology compilation, semantic changes, decisions, ledger history, replayed graph state, queries, provenance, and exact evidence. This revision exposes that path in plain language while keeping fixture-specific mapping, query, and evidence code private and clearly labeled."
